    return ("Knobs: Tayda KN1250 fluted ABS, 14.9 × 10.45 mm, $0.49, " + knobs + " ×25 + MOD; CUTOFF: Tayda 1083 serrated pointer, "
            "20.8 × 12.15 mm, $0.38 (cream only). Layout (visual, round 2): knob pitch 20 mm, IV front row 25/24 mm, 7 mm from any knob to a "
            "section break. Keys: 25 Kailh Choc V2 silent + D31 magnet over a flat SS49E; VELOCITY toggle LOUD / BOTH / FILT. "
            "Speaker: 50 mm Same Sky CDS-5076 (7.6 mm deep, eng), firing down. Name: to come (owner)." + (" " + extra if extra else ""))

